---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import '../styles/inner-pages.css';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy  | Scrap My Car UAE"
  description="Privacy policy for Scrap My Car UAE explaining the information we collect, how it may be used and the choices available to website users."
  canonical="https://www.scrapmycaruae.com/privay-policy"
>
  <main>
    <section class="inner-hero">
      <div class="smc-container inner-hero-grid">
        <div>
          <div class="smc-kicker">Privacy</div>
          <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
          <p>
            This policy explains how Scrap My Car UAE may collect, use and protect information provided through our website and related services.
          </p>
        </div>
        <aside class="inner-hero-aside">
          <strong>Who we are</strong>
          <span>Scrap My Car UAE / ScrapMyCarUAE.com is legally operated as Faizan Khan Used Auto Spare Parts Trading LLC, Al Sajaa Industrial Area, Sajaa, Sharjah, UAE.</span>
        </aside>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="page-shell">
      <div class="smc-container content-grid">
        <aside class="side-card">
          <div class="smc-kicker">Privacy questions</div>
          <h2>Contact us.</h2>
          <p>If you have a question or concern about this privacy policy or information you have provided, contact Scrap My Car UAE.</p>
          <a class="smc-button smc-button-secondary" href="/contact-us">Contact Us</a>
        </aside>

        <div class="prose">
          <section>
            <h2>About this policy</h2>
            <p>Thank you for choosing Scrap My Car UAE. We are committed to handling user information responsibly across our website and online services.</p>
            <p>This policy applies to information collected through Scrap My Car UAE. Third-party services and companies may operate under their own privacy policies.</p>
            <p>Our services are intended for adults. If you are under 18, please do not submit personal information through the website.</p>
          </section>

          <section>
            <h2>Information provided by users</h2>
            <p>We may collect information that you voluntarily provide when requesting a vehicle valuation, contacting us or otherwise interacting with the service.</p>
            <p>This may include your name, telephone or WhatsApp number, email address, vehicle make, model, year, vehicle condition and other details you choose to provide.</p>
          </section>

          <section>
            <h2>Automated information</h2>
            <p>When you use the website, technical information may be collected automatically. This can include IP address, browser type, operating system, device information, access time, pages visited and referral information.</p>
          </section>

          <section>
            <h2>Location information</h2>
            <p>If a feature asks for location access and you choose to provide permission, location information may be used to provide location-specific services or information.</p>
          </section>

          <section>
            <h2>Information from other sources</h2>
            <p>Information you provide may be combined with information obtained through our service providers or other legitimate sources where appropriate for operating and improving the service.</p>
          </section>

          <section>
            <h2>How we use information</h2>
            <p>Information may be used to:</p>
            <ul>
              <li>Respond to vehicle valuation requests.</li>
              <li>Contact users about an ongoing vehicle sale or collection.</li>
              <li>Provide customer support.</li>
              <li>Operate, maintain and improve the website and services.</li>
              <li>Understand website usage and resolve technical issues.</li>
              <li>Prevent fraud or misuse.</li>
              <li>Comply with applicable legal obligations.</li>
            </ul>
          </section>

          <section>
            <h2>Information sharing</h2>
            <p>Scrap My Car UAE does not sell user information. Information may be shared with service providers where needed to operate the service, process a request, maintain the website or meet legal and security obligations.</p>
            <p>Where third-party providers process information on our behalf, they may only use that information for the services they provide to us and subject to the applicable arrangements.</p>
          </section>

          <section>
            <h2>Your choices</h2>
            <p>You may choose not to provide personal information, although this can prevent us from processing a valuation or responding to a request.</p>
            <p>You can also manage cookies and similar technologies through your browser settings where applicable.</p>
          </section>

          <section>
            <h2>Contact</h2>
            <p>For questions or concerns about this privacy policy, contact us at info@scrapmycaruae.com or through the Contact Us page.</p>
          </section>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
